UFI-TOOLS-U60-PRO-RE is an independent interoperability implementation for the
ZTE U60 Pro device family.

The project may incorporate or adapt portions of the MIT-licensed UFI-TOOLS
project by kanoqwq. Such files must retain their original copyright and MIT
license notices. New project code is AGPL-3.0-or-later unless a file says
otherwise.

No closed-source executable, decompiler output, signing secret, private server
credential, Qualcomm proprietary utility, firmware image, or device backup is
part of this repository. Names and protocol descriptions are used only to
identify compatible interfaces.

